  "plan.forever":"forever","plan.per_month":"per month","plan.f1":"Unlimited free recognition in the browser","plan.f2":"100+ recognition languages","plan.f3":"Export to DOCX, PDF, ODT, TXT","plan.f4":"History on your device","plan.f5":"{free_gens} Pro-mode pages free on sign-up, then {price_per_page} ₽ per page","plan.free_cta":"Start free","app.plan_free_note":"Free: unlimited recognition in the browser, 100+ languages, export to DOCX, PDF, Р7, TXT and photo — no sign-up, no watermarks.","app.plan_pro_note":"Pro: AI mode with no daily cap — handwriting, tables, translation into 30+ languages, searchable PDF, and email sending.",
  "plan.p1":"Everything in Free","plan.p2":"Reads handwriting and tables, keeps document structure","plan.p3":"Translation into 30+ languages","plan.p4":"Searchable PDF from many photos","plan.p5":"Cancel in one click","plan.pro_cta":"Get Pro","plan.popular":"Popular",
  "pricing.note":"The subscription renews automatically every 30 days. Turn it off in your account in one click. We'll e-mail you 3 days before each charge.",
  "faq.title":"FAQ","faq.q1":"Is it really free?","faq.a1":"Yes. In-browser recognition, exports and history are free and unlimited, no watermarks. Only handwriting, tables and translation are paid, because every such page costs us money.",
  "faq.q2":"Where do my photos go?","faq.a2":"In free mode — nowhere: text is recognized in your browser. For DOCX and PDF only the text is sent to the server. In paid mode (handwriting, tables, translation) the photo is sent to a language model running on our own equipment and not stored after the answer. History stays on your device.",
  "faq.q3":"How accurate is it?","faq.a3":"Clear printed text is recognized well; blurry, dark and handwritten photos are harder. Paid mode reads handwriting and tables better and marks unclear parts [?]. Always check important documents.",
  "faq.q4":"How do I cancel?","faq.a4":"In your account, press “Turn off auto-renewal”. Pro keeps working until the end of the paid period, with no further charges.",
  "faq.q5":"Which languages are supported?","faq.a5":"Recognition covers 100+ languages including English, Spanish, Chinese, Arabic and Russian. Paid mode translates into 30+ languages. The interface is available in 8.",
  "faq.q6":"Does it work on a phone?","faq.a6":"Yes. Press “Use camera” to open your camera. It works in any modern browser, nothing to install.","faq.more":"Read more in the blog →",
  "footer.tagline":"Sees text even in the dark","footer.privacy":"Privacy","footer.offer":"Terms","footer.about":"About",
  "footer.max":"Follow on MAX →","footer.tg":"Follow on Telegram →",
